- `apps/ios/` — native SwiftUI iOS app. `project.yml` (XcodeGen) is the source of truth; simulator-buildable with **no signing** (`CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED: NO` — flip to a team + automatic signing only for device/TestFlight builds). Bundle id `{{BUNDLE_PREFIX}}.ios`; Info.plist keys are generated (`GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE` + `INFOPLIST_KEY_*` in project.yml). Add an `NS*UsageDescription` only for capabilities the app actually exercises.
